---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-linea bg-via/30 px-8 py-10">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1040px] flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6">
    <div class="flex-1">
      <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#54575F]">
        Ando por LinkedIn casi todas las semanas escribiendo sobre todo esto.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5">
        <a
          href="https://linkedin.com/in/carloscordobacamacho"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-[3px] bg-senal px-[22px] py-[13px] font-mono text-[13px] text-white transition-transform hover:-translate-y-px"
        >
          LinkedIn ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-right font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#8B8D93]">
      ccordoba.dev<br />
      {year}
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
